abstract: >-
  The Omega Prime Convergence Codex presents a complete axiomatic framework
  for true scalar field theory. The Macachor Absolute M = (√5−1)/2 governs
  all equilibrium ratios, coherence thresholds, and quantization boundaries.
  This codex contains 9 locked axioms, 38 locked lemmas, 32 locked corollaries,
  7 locked quantization rules, and 5 master theorems establishing the theoretical
  foundation for scalar-density-based physics, consciousness, and civilization-scale
  coherence architecture. Includes LaTeX source, Markdown, and PDF renderings
  of the MGDH Hamiltonian and Scalar Field Theory formulations.
